Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.81,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I WANT TO CHANGE THE WORLD　源源不绝的热情{\fad(500,00)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:11.90,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向着怦然心动的未来  伸出双手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:18.21,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能够放出光芒　IT'S WONDERLAND
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.48,0:00:24.03,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,未来那无法预测的黑夜  震撼着你的心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.15,0:00:31.83,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法相信任何东西  你充耳不闻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:39.45,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你相遇的瞬间  我找到了真正的归宿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.95,0:00:48.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不自觉的温柔呈现在面前  把我们唤醒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:55.18,OP2,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I WANT TO CHANGE THE WORLD　不会再迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.18,0:01:04.92,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要构筑起跟你在一起的未来  就能飞向任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.92,0:01:10.06,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,CHANGE MY MIND　源源不绝的热情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.35,0:01:15.14,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向着未知的明天  张开双翼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.14,0:01:21.92,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能够展翅飞翔　IT'S WONDERLAND{\fad(0000,480)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.17,0:22:24.83,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一味地  只知道逞强的我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.50,0:22:32.33,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  从那时起我不再茫然
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.34,0:22:39.92,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定有想要与你分享的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.08,0:22:48.19,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也有许多想向你倾诉的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.39,0:22:55.20,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论是笑容还是泪颜都想呈现给你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.20,0:22:59.30,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等待着  将曾经放弃的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.30,0:23:03.10,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,机会重新抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.51,0:23:10.19,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想着你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.41,0:23:18.22,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要如此  便觉得心变得坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.62,0:23:25.33,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这份渺茫的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.83,0:23:29.50,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论何时都在祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.80,0:23:34.78,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能够传达给你…{\fad(0000,1310)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.46,0:01:42.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然飞天少爷真的很迷人 不过满天少爷才是最帅的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.33,0:01:45.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是他的黑发太迷人了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.27,0:01:48.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然只要有头发的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.34,0:01:50.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就可以跟飞天哥哥一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.21,0:01:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受到这么多女人的欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.26,0:01:59.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.70,0:02:00.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.05,0:02:04.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.35,0:02:06.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:08.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是有头发就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.19,0:02:10.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是有头发就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.43,0:02:18.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从思春期开始
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.57,0:02:21.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就一直做着类似这样的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.74,0:02:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我也有一头浓密的头发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.41,0:02:27.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不见得比得上飞天哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.14,0:02:31.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得自己的外型也还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.15,0:02:33.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好希望有一天能像飞天哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.62,0:02:37.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一头浓密的长发 受到女人欢迎啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.56,0:02:43.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狩猎啦 满天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.16,0:02:46.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 飞天哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.53,0:02:48.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雷击刃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.44,0:02:56.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后用这招了结你们！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.47,0:03:01.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要瞄准那里应该可以打倒他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.65,0:03:07.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:11.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的头发…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.05,0:03:14.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.96,0:03:15.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.06,0:03:18.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你身上有四魂之玉的碎片这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.26,0:03:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.93,0:03:23.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我就把你给杀了 然后再把它抢过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.03,0:03:28.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才要你的四魂之玉的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.27,0:03:36.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看你能承受我的雷击到什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.62,0:03:45.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好像只有蛮力嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.19,0:03:47.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我就好好陪你玩一玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.62,0:03:51.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个雷兽小子 不太好对付…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.09,0:03:57.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖刀激战！雷击刃VS铁碎牙！！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.59,0:04:03.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 看样子你是我值得一战的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.06,0:04:06.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可要好好陪我玩哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.86,0:04:08.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去对我说这种大话的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.86,0:04:12.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来没有一个到最后还觉得好玩的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.13,0:04:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那正好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.73,0:04:17.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就好好尝一尝我雷击刃的滋味吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.77,0:04:22.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.04,0:04:26.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不接好的话 可是会死哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.71,0:04:28.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞天的雷击刃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.11,0:04:31.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果被砍到的话 恐怕连我也受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:35.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 飞天就交给你来解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.49,0:04:37.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇就由我来救她
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.99,0:04:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:42.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油啊 飞天哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.86,0:04:44.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我助你一臂之力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.06,0:04:47.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个打一个 真是太卑鄙了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.64,0:04:56.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.15,0:05:03.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.08,0:05:07.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是担心女人的时候吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.89,0:05:09.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.02,0:05:12.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我救你之前 你自己要加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.39,0:05:16.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这种情况下你叫我怎么加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.26,0:05:18.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛好痛 不过幸好得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.03,0:05:20.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个臭丫头…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.97,0:05:22.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.33,0:05:23.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.84,0:05:34.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐妖术 雷霆万钧陀螺！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.79,0:05:44.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 快来这边
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.49,0:05:45.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:49.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 没有想到你还有这么厉害的招术
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:50.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.93,0:05:53.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在安心还太早了点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.57,0:05:54.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:57.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐妖术只是障眼法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.00,0:06:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,障眼法？这么说那只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.37,0:06:02.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛痛痛痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.14,0:06:03.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是幻影罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.21,0:06:10.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死 那只可恶的小狐狸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.25,0:06:17.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:19.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有了 没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:22.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的头发！！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:27.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟敢把我的最后一根头发给…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.41,0:06:36.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像火上浇油了啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:38.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.28,0:06:42.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在…哪…里…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.18,0:06:46.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生发剂还有该死的小狐狸…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.35,0:06:49.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑到什么地方去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.69,0:06:51.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎…怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.56,0:06:53.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被他发现的话只有死路一条的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.63,0:06:55.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 那支箭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.49,0:06:57.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定还可以派上用场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.50,0:06:59.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.70,0:07:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那里吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.88,0:07:13.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个臭丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:17.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为逃得出我的手掌心吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.45,0:07:20.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗唆 你这个光溜溜的大秃头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.79,0:07:22.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:25.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧 这就是你最喜欢的头发
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.89,0:07:28.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有两个臭丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.29,0:07:31.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的箭…快点还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.83,0:07:33.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是…小狐狸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.46,0:07:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要替我爸爸报仇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.97,0:07:38.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你就像这样子缠住他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.04,0:07:42.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要撬出他额头上的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.41,0:07:43.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能打倒他！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:48.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:54.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你给掐死…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:07:58.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬…犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.62,0:08:00.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.56,0:08:05.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你分什么神啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:14.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你也只会说大话而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.87,0:08:17.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来还以为你能陪我玩久一点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.71,0:08:19.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吓破胆了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.21,0:08:22.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来慢慢折磨你 先砍断你的手脚来玩好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.71,0:08:24.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法专心跟他斗…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.78,0:08:26.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是要先解决戈薇那边
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.09,0:08:28.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看啊 满天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.52,0:08:31.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个半妖小子吓到站不起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.96,0:08:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这边也很好玩哦 飞天哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.23,0:08:37.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:40.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这临死的女人的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.13,0:08:42.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.23,0:08:43.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.50,0:08:45.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.11,0:08:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很不甘心吧 你这只臭小狐狸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.21,0:08:55.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着吧 等我杀了这个女人之后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.38,0:08:57.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就来剥你的毛皮了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.08,0:09:00.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你老爸一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.65,0:09:04.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的毛皮就拿来做头巾好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.09,0:09:09.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就让你们父子的毛皮在我的身上团聚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.16,0:09:10.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满天
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.40,0:09:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也变得这么会说话了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.50,0:09:17.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥夸奖我了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.27,0:09:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.24,0:09:24.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.01,0:09:27.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我死也不会放开的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:29.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个臭小子 给我放开
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.25,0:09:32.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:36.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再不放开的话 我就把你的头骨打碎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:39.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满天
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.69,0:09:42.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心点别让血弄脏了毛皮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.79,0:09:44.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样就做不了头巾了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.30,0:09:46.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.53,0:09:50.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我也不是什么好人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:56.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你们更烂得叫人恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.14,0:09:57.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞刃血爪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.81,0:10:02.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有意思 再多抵抗点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.45,0:10:10.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 你往什么地方丢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.69,0:10:12.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.36,0:10:19.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满…满天！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.47,0:10:22.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.70,0:10:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.70,0:10:26.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得拿给犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.10,0:10:28.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.24,0:10:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了…还有七宝爸爸的毛皮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:32.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满天
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.48,0:10:35.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 快点离开那个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.98,0:10:37.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.99,0:10:42.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满天
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:45.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞天哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.72,0:10:48.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的头发都没有了…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.59,0:10:51.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不想活了…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.23,0:10:52.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在胡说什么 满天
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.96,0:10:54.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要挺住！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.90,0:10:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞天哥哥你的头发…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.73,0:10:58.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟老爸的一模一样…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.87,0:11:02.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好希望自己能长得像老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老妈能要是能漂亮一点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.51,0:11:08.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者头上的头发多一点也好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.75,0:11:09.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.75,0:11:13.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爸到底看上老妈哪一点要跟她结婚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.02,0:11:15.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞天哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.02,0:11:18.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外表长什么样子并不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.22,0:11:21.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我唯一最心爱的弟弟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.53,0:11:24.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 飞天哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.13,0:11:25.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经想过下辈子投胎的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:29.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己能够变成毛毛虫也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.23,0:11:31.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为全身都有毛茸茸的毛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.67,0:11:33.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过现在我不想了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.30,0:11:35.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下辈子投胎的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.24,0:11:37.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我的头上还是没有头发
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.28,0:11:40.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是希望能够当飞天哥哥你的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:43.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以吗 哥哥…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.92,0:11:47.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满天 喂 满天
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.69,0:11:50.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你还活着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.69,0:11:53.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:55.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有把铁碎牙拿回来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.13,0:11:57.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是为了那把刀拖拖拉拉的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.43,0:11:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 你还救了我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.93,0:12:02.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你少担心那些有的没有的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.20,0:12:07.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算没有刀我也不会输给那个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.21,0:12:08.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满天…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.41,0:12:14.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满天他死了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.98,0:12:16.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可怜的弟弟…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.45,0:12:21.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥永远都会跟你在一起的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.93,0:12:30.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他…他在吃他的弟弟吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.19,0:12:32.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:33.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞天这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.97,0:12:36.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是把满天额头上的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.17,0:12:38.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸进自己的体内
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.44,0:12:40.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷 你要特别小心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.84,0:12:45.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙已经有5个四魂碎片的力量了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.31,0:12:47.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先别说这些 冥加爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.35,0:12:49.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚又溜到哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.98,0:12:52.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正还不是逃到安全的地方去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.95,0:12:55.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次都等到安全的时候才肯出来露个面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.12,0:12:58.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天我要揍扁你！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.09,0:13:01.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要计较这点芝麻绿豆的事嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.23,0:13:04.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.00,0:13:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们然敢杀死我最心爱的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.34,0:13:16.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.48,0:13:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雷击刃的威力又增强了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.11,0:13:25.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,5个四魂碎片的力量真不是盖的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.75,0:13:29.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你带着七宝走能逃多远就逃多远
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.39,0:13:29.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.24,0:13:30.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:47.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀弟之仇 我非报不可
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.04,0:13:54.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太大了 根本躲不开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:57.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷 用铁碎牙的刀鞘吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.68,0:13:59.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙的刀鞘？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.15,0:14:02.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能抵挡雷击的 快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.45,0:14:03.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.96,0:14:10.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.45,0:14:29.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜的果然没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.05,0:14:32.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能收纳妖刀铁碎牙的刀鞘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.85,0:14:36.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照理说也应该可以抵挡得了雷兽的妖力才对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.72,0:14:39.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好我的猜测没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.09,0:14:42.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你果然是乱说的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.56,0:14:45.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之我刚才差点因为跑得太慢而死在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.73,0:14:47.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易才捡回这条命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.63,0:14:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看我们还是快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:52.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑 我就要用这个来对付他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.87,0:14:55.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你的命！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.24,0:15:00.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要能近他的身 就能打倒他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.58,0:15:06.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要近谁的身啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.99,0:15:11.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.39,0:15:16.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是爸爸的毛皮…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.76,0:15:18.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你醒了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.76,0:15:21.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 满天他怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.60,0:15:23.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满天已经被犬夜叉杀掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.77,0:15:25.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是飞天变得更强了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.14,0:15:28.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算不把你烧成黑炭也要把你剁成肉酱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.28,0:15:35.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉陷入苦战了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.11,0:15:38.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是因为飞天可以自在地飞来飞去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.75,0:15:41.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞天的风火轮？对了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:48.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为四魂之玉的碎片 他的移动速度快了好多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:52.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是有弓就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.66,0:15:54.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.13,0:15:57.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不报恩的话 我爸一定会很生气的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.70,0:16:02.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 七宝可以变成弓
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:05.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是蜗牛吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.04,0:16:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是弓
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.55,0:16:14.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.05,0:16:16.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点把箭射出去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.42,0:16:18.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的箭只剩这一支
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:20.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我射得不太准…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.46,0:16:22.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也会助你一臂之力的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.96,0:16:25.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.07,0:16:29.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.84,0:16:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,射中了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.41,0:16:36.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:38.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是傻瓜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:39.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太乱来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:42.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算犬夜叉少爷的身体很耐打
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.61,0:16:46.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直接握着雷击刃能做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.45,0:16:49.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冥加爷爷 你什么时候跑过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.59,0:16:52.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点放手啊 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.49,0:16:54.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个刀鞘真碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.19,0:17:00.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个大笨蛋 谁叫你扔掉刀鞘了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.60,0:17:02.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样才能够放手一搏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.54,0:17:11.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道我的厉害了吧 你这个大额头！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.08,0:17:13.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打…打飞了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.08,0:17:15.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然很简单 可是好厉害…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.05,0:17:17.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不愧是犬夜叉少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.08,0:17:19.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是想用体力来一决胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.62,0:17:22.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样 快点揍扁他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.39,0:17:25.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才不是才骂他大笨蛋吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:35.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脸被打中
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.73,0:17:37.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是我生平第一次呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.90,0:17:39.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在发热
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.94,0:17:41.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好强的热气
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:47.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你完蛋了 臭小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.72,0:17:57.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀鞘裂开了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.36,0:18:02.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个半妖臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.13,0:18:05.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真干了不少好事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.43,0:18:08.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 万一刀鞘的结界被破坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.90,0:18:11.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算犬夜叉少爷身体再结实也…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.17,0:18:12.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没希望了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.57,0:18:17.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要把铁碎牙拿给犬夜叉才行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.01,0:18:19.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 让我来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.44,0:18:22.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 不行 你现在过去太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.88,0:18:26.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.45,0:18:28.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是满天的雷击波？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.45,0:18:30.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想用他弟弟的绝招？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.45,0:18:32.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,危险 快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.26,0:18:39.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:41.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 活该
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.50,0:18:43.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.77,0:18:47.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人跟那个小鬼都死了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:50.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.21,0:18:52.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.48,0:18:57.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.21,0:18:58.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明只是半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.38,0:19:01.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然比那些下等妖怪还要顽强难缠
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.69,0:19:05.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在打倒你之前我是绝对不会死的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:08.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的女人被杀就气昏头了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.49,0:19:10.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少为了这种无聊的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.73,0:19:12.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我罗罗嗦嗦的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.56,0:19:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弟弟被杀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.73,0:19:16.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这个做哥哥的心里有多难过
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.33,0:19:18.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要让你彻底知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.34,0:19:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊…要断了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:25.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.85,0:19:35.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.09,0:19:37.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀鞘唤来了刀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.92,0:19:39.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.03,0:19:48.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我居然输了…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.20,0:19:50.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,输给了该死的半妖…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.53,0:19:52.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我竟然会…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.08,0:20:05.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷 是四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:07.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:10.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我能够快点打倒飞天的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:14.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.12,0:20:15.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.46,0:20:20.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…谢谢你帮我很多忙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.80,0:20:23.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是 能报杀父之仇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.57,0:20:25.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.80,0:20:28.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那应该是他们两个人的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.31,0:20:30.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想来跟你做最后的道别吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.11,0:20:31.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:34.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 别走
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.09,0:20:42.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:46.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.16,0:20:49.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还活着？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.83,0:20:51.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫我别去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.23,0:20:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 是你用狐火保护了我们吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.67,0:21:05.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如我所见的 那是从毛皮发出来的狐火
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.34,0:21:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才明明说是他们的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.05,0:21:10.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才是刚才 现在是现在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.75,0:21:12.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.52,0:21:16.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们别老说些让人误会的话啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.19,0:21:18.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死了就说死了 没有死就说没有死
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.79,0:21:20.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分清楚点行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.63,0:21:28.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 犬夜叉 你怎么了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.37,0:21:31.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在生什么气嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.17,0:21:33.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为犬夜叉少爷刚才太激动搞错了状况
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.60,0:21:34.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害他现在恼羞成怒了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.97,0:21:37.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷果然还是很孩子气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.48,0:21:44.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 七宝 你该回去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.21,0:21:47.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛啊 我就不能跟着你们吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.45,0:21:49.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么关系嘛 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.15,0:21:51.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝一个人孤孤单单的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.36,0:21:55.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 没错 我也是个弱小的孩子哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.89,0:21:58.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就会在这个时候装出小孩的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.10,0:22:01.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你什么时候才肯滚回去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.00,0:22:04.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇…他欺负我！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.67,0:22:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你不要太过份了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.97,0:22:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.87,0:22:09.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还像是个小孩一样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.65,0:23:50.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我所居住的日暮神社是十分古老的神社
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.56,0:23:53.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我一直不太相信爷爷的祈祷跟咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.06,0:23:57.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是从古井可以连接到战国时代来看
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.43,0:23:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里果然相当古老
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.43,0:24:02.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且以前就做过不少驱妖除魔的委托
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.67,0:24:05.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神社收纳的能面烧掉了封印它的符咒
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.54,0:24:07.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且攻击我们
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.54,0:24:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉 在现代复活的诅咒能面
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.64,0:24:13.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.02,0:24:18.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉宝典
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.47,0:24:26.52,KEYPOINT,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(357,290)}七宝的杀父仇人 哥哥飞天使用雷击刃
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.47,0:24:26.52,KEYPOINT,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(266,437}弟弟满天吐出\N雷击波
